      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON NATIONAL (6) is in top form lately including an excellent win at Ballarat in 21.96 two back then backing it up with a 23.27 victory at Horsham over 410m latest. Expected to push the clock again here. STAR FURY (7) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 2.25 lengths fourth (22.16) over 390m at this track. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Should be about the money. PAW QUEBEC (2) stalked the lead from a middle box before hitting the front turning and lifting to score (27.97) at Bendigo in a Grade 4/5 over 500m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Should feature again. PAW EDEN (1) will give backers a sight.",
